[{"id":"yuan-era:512","title":"西江月","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"顿悟修行道理，除情战睡敌魔。","body":{"start":502,"hash":"3fac0960e8d2b140f56edd95734c31190934ea5fb86e13b57c5fe0da8b2e1a1d"}},{"id":"yuan-era:513","title":"西江月","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"食饱伤心损气，睡多梦里迷真。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:514","title":"一寸金 赏雪","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"暮鸿嘹唳。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:515","title":"一剪梅","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"粗布宽衣下领袍。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:516","title":"二郎神","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"小张歌，也好把、繁华勘破。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:517","title":"八声甘州","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"一团春雪，抛在玉炉中煎。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:518","title":"八声甘州","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"千门万户，尽七倾八倒，掘地寻天。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:519","title":"上平西","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"这无常，两个字，最难防。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:520","title":"上平西","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"引清风，邀明月，去来兮。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:521","title":"山亭柳","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"世事堪忧。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:522","title":"太常引","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"光阴迅速不停留。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:523","title":"太常引","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"百年勋业镜中看。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:524","title":"忆江南","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"长生药，本是五行仙。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:525","title":"忆江南","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"十月满，开鼎一团红。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:526","title":"忆江南","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"还丹术，切要经手传。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:527","title":"忆江南","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"才举意，玄象照离宫。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:528","title":"斗鹌鹑","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"木马嘶风，我之不然。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:529","title":"无俗念","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"全真大道理无穷，妙得至人端的。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:530","title":"无俗念","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"浮生碌碌。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:531","title":"无俗念","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"茅庵交坐，任清虚冷淡，心香频爇。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:532","title":"无俗念","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"参玄龃龉，强钻研道法，坚如钢铁。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:533","title":"月上海棠","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"昨夜因打北邙山过。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:534","title":"月上海棠","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"吾言劝了千千万。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:535","title":"木兰花慢","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"本轻清体妙，湛然独与天游。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:536","title":"水仙子","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"百年三万六千场，风雨忧愁一半妨。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:537","title":"双调 水仙子 失题","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"青山隐隐水茫茫，时节登高却异乡。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:538","title":"水龙吟","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","excerpt":"本自出家离尘世。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:539","title":"水龙吟","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"玉炉百和发虔心，信香一炷，氤氲缭绕。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:540","title":"水调歌头","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"五行不到处，一气未生前。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:541","title":"水调歌头","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"东风卷帘幕，时物又新奇。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:542","title":"四块玉","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"光景如梭，劝早早回头寻活计。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:543","title":"失调名 自乐","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"醉时节、就把青山靠。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:544","title":"归朝欢","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"天地初分何处寄。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:545","title":"永遇乐","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"行也无忧，坐也无闷，长安长乐。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:546","title":"永遇乐","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"养水养精，养神养血，先须养气。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:547","title":"永遇乐","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"试问诸公，本来模样，如何形状。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:548","title":"永遇乐","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"忙里偷闲，闹中取静，利名休竞。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:549","title":"永遇乐","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"万法由心，应观法界，一切心造。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:550","title":"玉交梭 梭疑枝之误","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"我已叮咛劝。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:551","title":"玉抱肚","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"若论玄妙，听周风一诀。","body":0},{"id":"yuan-era:552","title":"玉胡蝶","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"捉住玉山赤凤，神舟同泛，激浪漂浮。","body":{"start":552,"hash":"275e127665ab5591ec15d485fdfc9fb3ab9ef894085506415c36f0910485d2a8"}},{"id":"yuan-era:553","title":"玉胡蝶","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"为甚夜来添病，强临宝鉴，憔悴娇慵。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:554","title":"玉液泉","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"这消息，几人知，独我全真好。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:555","title":"甘露滴乔松","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"光阴迅速，叹世人朝朝，贪生无已。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:556","title":"生查子","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"夜来忽睹一场希，乍见几个灯蛾儿，堪人嗟呀。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:557","title":"如梦令","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"猛悟百年弹指。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:558","title":"如梦令","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"学道非难非易。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:559","title":"导引 大定二十七年三月皇太孙受册谢庙","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"璇源浚发，衍庆自灵长。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:560","title":"导引 大定三年十月祫享顺銮应钟宫","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"礼行清庙，华黍荐年丰。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:561","title":"导引 天德二年三月祫享回銮姑洗宫","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"礼成庙享，御卫拱飞龙。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:562","title":"导引 正隆六年