:"真假两般玄字，金公所料重遗。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:580","title":"贺圣朝","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"一理无今无古，此心何喜何嗔。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:581","title":"西江月","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"至道不烦不远，至人只在目前。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:582","title":"齐天乐","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"自清都别后，人间梦中游戏。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:583","title":"吴音子","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"欲要神仙做，抱元气，胎息绵绵。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:584","title":"折桂令","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"叹世间多少痴人，多是忙人，少是闲人。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:585","title":"折桂令 微雪","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"朔风寒吹下银沙，蠹砌穿帘，拂柳惊鸦，轻若鹅毛，娇如柳絮，瘦似梨花。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:586","title":"添声杨柳枝","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"已谢芳华更不留。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:587","title":"步步娇","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"真行与真功。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:588","title":"步步娇","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"传得一口诀。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:589","title":"步步娇","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"遍地有灵芝。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:590","title":"步步娇","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"休执性为真。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:591","title":"步步娇","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"柔弱好家风。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:592","title":"步步娇","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"无为自然道。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:593","title":"步步娇","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"俺在炕上坐。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:594","title":"步步娇","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"贫子吃好酒，吃得酩酊休。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:595","title":"步步娇","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"信则你自信，不信你休行。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:596","title":"步步高（北曲）","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"二更里，白牛溪边睡。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:597","title":"步步高（北曲）","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"三更里，银汉星移淡。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:598","title":"步步高（北曲）","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"一更里，澄心披襟坐。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:599","title":"步步高（北曲）","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"四更里，玄圃清风细。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:600","title":"步步高（北曲）","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"五更里，架上金鸡叫。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:601","title":"沁园春","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"切劝学人，悟取灵台，休得外求。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:602","title":"沁园春","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"遇此荒年，天下门徒，受魔受难。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:603","title":"沁园春","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"瑞雪翻云，长风舞浪，仙家画图。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:604","title":"沁园春","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"古往今来，一刹那间，又早百年。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:605","title":"沁园春","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"大道无名，大音希声，大器晚成。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:606","title":"沁园春","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"不喜轻裘，布衣芒履，任春与秋。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:607","title":"沁园春","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"瑞雪长空，布满周天，色似银。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:608","title":"沁园春","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"昨夜南京，今朝北岳，倏焉忽然。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:609","title":"沁园春","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"绝品龙团，制造幽微，建溪路赊。","body":40},{"id":"yuan-era:610","title":"沁园春","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"打破疑团，谢了空花，饮啄随缘。","body":{"start":610,"hash":"54b4d43349201409d93a1f2b74ecf8af3b1fe347df44f37254945437c978c1fd"}},{"id":"yuan-era:611","title":"沁园春","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"自古神仙，隐迹终南，万代流传。","body":98},{"id":"yuan-era:612","title":"苏幕遮","author":"无名氏","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"精气神，须保爱。","body":98},{"id":"yuan-era:613","title":"苏幕遮","author":"无名氏","collecti